# WORKAROUND(astro-prerender-cookie): Astro 7's prerender chunk (dist/.prerender)
# imports "cookie" bare from the project root, which pnpm's isolated layout does
# not expose, so Node resolves a stray parent node_modules copy (or fails).
# Correct fix: Astro resolves "cookie" from its own package; drop this once it does.
# Ref: found 2026-09-18 while scaffolding docs/site (astro 7.3.3 + pnpm 10); pending user review
public-hoist-pattern[]=cookie
